1
00:00:00,561 --> 00:00:01,641
(Penny:)Right.

2
00:00:01,854 --> 00:00:06,154
(Sheldon:)Just to be clear, do I have to stop
saying "coitus" with everyone or just you?

3
00:00:07,610 --> 00:00:09,240
(Sheldon:)Everyone.

4
00:00:10,029 --> 00:00:11,819
(Sheldon:)Harsh terms, but all right.

5
00:00:11,989 --> 00:00:14,369
-I'll just substitute "intercourse."
-Great.

6
00:00:14,533 --> 00:00:16,493
SHELDON:
Or "fornication." Yeah--

7
00:00:16,660 --> 00:00:19,910
(Sheldon:)But that has judgmental overtones,
so I'll hold that in reserve.

8
00:00:20,372 --> 00:00:22,332
(Penny:)So how you been?

9
00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:25,130
(Sheldon:)Well, my existence is a continuum...

10
00:00:25,294 --> 00:00:30,044
(Sheldon:)...so I've been what I am at each point
in the implied time period.

11
00:00:31,717 --> 00:00:34,927
(Penny:)You're just coitusing with me,
aren't you?

12
00:00:37,098 --> 00:00:38,598
-Buzzinga.
-Mm.

13
00:00:40,684 --> 00:00:43,354
(Penny:)-How's Leonard doing?
-He seems all right...

14
00:00:43,521 --> 00:00:46,111
(Sheldon:)...although he does spend
a disturbing amount of time...

15
00:00:46,273 --> 00:00:50,903
(Sheldon:)...looking at photographs of you
and smelling the pillow you slept on.

16
00:00:51,445 --> 00:00:54,945
Although now that I think of it,
he asked me not to tell you that.

17
00:00:55,908 --> 00:00:58,158
PENNY:
I'll pretend I didn't hear it.

18
00:00:58,327 --> 00:01:01,027
(Sheldon:)I'd rather you pretend I didn't say it.

